  "full_text": "Padded Armor\n\nIntroduction. Padded Armor is a Plains-tier armor. This set is the tier above Fenris Set and Wolf Armor and is replaced by Carapace Armor or Eitr-weave Set.\n\nArmor pieces. This set of armor has four pieces, which are crafted and upgraded at both the Forge and the Workbench.\n\nTrivia. • Historically, it is yet to be confirmed whether Vikings wore padded armor. Assuming that they did, padded armor plausibly provided comfort as much as protection, more so if worn underneath mail armor (though it provided decent protection, mail armor did little to absorb or dissipate the force of a blow, resulting in bruises at best and broken bones at worst).",
